  "post_text": "Ask an agent what after-sales means in Spain and you get a list nobody ever wrote down. We wrote it down.\n\nOpening a Spanish account. Utilities into the client's name. The first IBI letter. The Modelo 210 return nobody warned them about. Home insurance. And a steady stream of paperwork that arrives in Spanish at a house that is empty most of the year.\n\nThat is the real content of after-sales for a foreign owner. None of it is the agent's job. All of it lands on the agent anyway, because the agent is the only person in Spain the client knows.\n\nWe built Bueno to be the other person they know. One annual subscription that bundles the account, property management tools, energy switching, non-resident tax filing and insurance, with multilingual human support behind all of it.\n\nThe agent hands the client over after completion, the client is cared for in their own language, and the list above stops arriving by text message.\n\nIf you recognise that list, my inbox is open.\n\n#RealEstateSpain #Proptech #SpainProperty",
